ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nAt an important business meeting, Li Hua is representing the company for a presentation. Halfway through the meeting, Li Hua suddenly forgets a key piece of data. When asked, he hastily answers, \"Our annual growth rate is 20%.\" However, the actual data is 31%. His response confuses the attendees.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Li Hua answer like this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Li Hua wants to test whether the attendees really pay attention to the company's data.\nB. Li Hua intentionally confuses the data to get more investment.\nC. Li Hua forgets the correct annual growth rate data.\nD. Li Hua thinks 20% is more acceptable, so he intentionally changes the data.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":4.878438121037369E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52bd1c2ddb05a7fe314b0","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452433535,"createTime":"2026-11-12 11:00:33","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"ca808ee6c94a4e299d64a5c956cefeb8"}